# Specification documents added by the project where NORA lacks them or links them wrongly.
@prefix e: <https://www.noraonline.nl/wiki/Eigenschap:> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<https://w3id.org/FAIR-course-UT/2026/group33/graph/specification-supplement> a prov:Entity ;
    rdfs:label "Curated supplement to the specification documents in NORA"@en ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/FAIR-course-UT/2026/group33/data#sounic-akkaraju> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://w3id.org/FAIR-course-UT/2026/group33/data#export-nora-standards> .

<https://www.noraonline.nl/wiki/Special:URIResolver/FS:Dnssec> rdfs:comment "Supplement: NORA gives no specification document for DNSSEC; its version field lists RFC 4033, RFC 4034 and RFC 4035."@en ;
    e:Specificatiedocument <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4033>,
        <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4034>,
        <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4035> .

<https://www.noraonline.nl/wiki/Special:URIResolver/FS:Ipv6> rdfs:comment "Supplement: NORA links RFC 791 (IPv4) and RFC 2460 (obsoleted by RFC 8200); IPv6 is specified in RFC 8200."@en ;
    e:Specificatiedocument <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8200> .

<https://www.noraonline.nl/wiki/Special:URIResolver/FS:Tls> rdfs:comment "Supplement: NORA links an Internet-Draft (draft-ietf-tls-tls13) while its version field says '1.3 en 1.2'; TLS 1.3 is RFC 8446 and TLS 1.2 is RFC 5246."@en ;
    e:Specificatiedocument <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5246>,
        <https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446> .

